  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed second-floor extension to the roof, by virtue of its scale, siting and materials, will provide for a bulky, top-heavy and unduly prominent form of development that will dominate the rear roof slope of the host dwelling and is one that lacks any sense of subservience. This is considered harmful to the character and appearance of the host dwelling and wider row of terraced properties and is contrary to the design objectives of Policy 53 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;/p&gt;"
